# Production (Vercel): leave unset or empty so the browser calls same-origin /api/*
# Next.js rewrites proxy to the ASP.NET API (avoids HTTPS→HTTP mixed content).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=

# Optional server-only proxy target (used by next.config rewrites)
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://trustora.runasp.net

# Local UI against local API:
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5080
